  "content": {
    "title": "WrestleMania 2026 results: Who won each match from Nights 1 and 2 of WWE showpiece?",
    "text": "WrestleMania 42 is in the books, as WWE’s showpiece event wraps up for another year.The two-night show took place in Las Vegas’s Allegiant Stadium, just as it did in 2025, and it brought numerous title matches featuring star names.But who came out on top? Below, we look at every result from Night 1 and Night 2, after bouts involving Randy Orton, CM Punk, Cody Rhodes and Roman Reigns – and many more.Jade Cargill (left) and Rhea Ripley squaring off at WrestleMania 42 (Getty)Was there a star-making moment for Oba Femi against Brock Lesnar? Did Paige’s return to WWE result in a win, and did Bron Breakker’s return from injury cost his former ally Seth Rollins victory? Here are the answers to those questions: WrestleMania 42 resultsNight 1Jey Uso, Jimmy Uso and LA Knight def. Logan Paul, iShowSpeed and Austin TheoryJacob Fatu def. Drew McIntyre in Unsanctioned MatchPaige and Brie Bella def. Charlotte and Alexa Bliss; Bayley and Lyra Valkyria; and Lash Legend and Nia Jax (win Women’s Tag-Team Titles)Becky Lynch def. AJ Lee (wins Women’s Intercontinental Title)Gunther def. Seth RollinsLiv Morgan def. Stephanie Vaquer (wins Women’s World Title)Cody Rhodes def. Randy Orton (retains WWE Title)Randy Orton hitting a super-plex on Cody Rhodes (Getty)Night 2Oba Femi def. Brock LesnarPenta def. Je’von Evans, Rey Mysterio, JD McDonagh, Dragon Lee and Rusev in Ladder Match (retains Intercontinental Title)Trick Williams def. Sami Zayn (wins United States Title)Rhea Ripley def. Jade Cargill (wins WWE Women’s Title)“Demon” Finn Balor def. Dominik Mysterio in Street FightRoman Reigns def. CM Punk (wins World Heavyweight Title)",
